Error [jet.TypestateWrongState]: `ship` needs `Order.Confirmed`, but `order` is `Order.Confirmed | Order.Draft`
  --> tests/ui/typestate/paths_meeting_in_different_states_reject_a_state_call.jet:22:11
    |
 22 |     order.ship()
    |           ^^^^
 Why: Typestate: `ship` takes only `Order.Confirmed`; calling it with `Order` in another state is the out-of-order bug the state list rules out
 Fix: Bring `order` to `Order.Confirmed` before calling `ship`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0150
